12. LIKE – Pattern Matching
LIKE searches text based on patterns.
Two important wildcards:
=> % – Zero or more characters.
=> _ – Exactly one character.
| Query        |         Meaning       |
|--------      |--------               |
| `LIKE 'S%'`  | Starts with S         |
| `LIKE '%a'`  | Ends with a           |
| `LIKE '%lo%'`| Contains lo           |
